        "n0013",
        "n0016"
      ],
      "range": [
        "spya-tgnssb",
        "spya-u774u3"
      ],
      "title": "Playing God With Machines",
      "gist": "Humanity has long dreamed of creating artificial beings, and as AI grows more capable, the question of whether it could be conscious raises serious ethical stakes for both machines and ourselves."
    },
