      ],
      "title": "What (Not) To Do?",
      "gist": "Given deep uncertainty about machine consciousness, we should avoid creating conscious AI while also taking seriously the separate dangers posed by AI that merely seems conscious.",
      "sourceHeading": "What (Not) To Do?"
    },
